{"unit_id": "saithink__dsh-local-proxy#card-zh", "repo": "saithink/dsh-local-proxy", "commit": "ee329f3505a9461da0dfb26c4ca4d9fc60bf8596", "type": "card", "lang": "zh", "text": "本地代理管理 (DSH 插件，Web 客户端)：它在 DSH 插件详情页提供全局网络代理控制面板，通过 Undici 调度器、Node 原生 HTTP/HTTPS 请求拦截和进程代理环境变量，将出站请求送往用户配置的代理服务器。主要功能包括启停代理、设置代理地址与绕过名单、应用常用代理端口、测试目标连通性并查看近期请求路由统计。适合需要统一管理 DSH 网络出口的用户；使用前需要本机可访问的 HTTP 或 HTTPS 代理地址，不需要额外 API Key。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:203-220", "client.js:310-320"]}
{"unit_id": "saithink__dsh-local-proxy#card-en", "repo": "saithink/dsh-local-proxy", "commit": "ee329f3505a9461da0dfb26c4ca4d9fc60bf8596", "type": "card", "lang": "en", "text": "Local Proxy is a DSH web plugin for outbound proxy management. It routes requests through Undici, native Node HTTP/HTTPS, and proxy environment variables. Its panel controls the proxy URL, bypass list, connectivity tests, and routing statistics. A reachable proxy is required; no API key is needed.", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:203-220", "client.js:310-320"]}
